    {
      "id": "claim_fecd4de2b65340acaa6636c01810d5e9",
      "statement": "The `Accept` component in `src/app/pages/invitations/accept/accept.ts` calls `auth.checkSession()` in its constructor when a token is present so that users returning from the consents gate see the accept form rather than a login form, and redirects to `/` on 404 when the user already has a session (the invitation was already used).",
